# Benchmark outputs: ignore EVERYTHING under the run dirs (multi-hundred-MB render/log dirs
# AND per-run .auth/ credential caches — never commit those). Only the latest full-suite run
# (internal/example_tasks/runs/) keeps its small self-contained report.html. run-stats.json stays
# local: it records per-round render-backend addresses (ephemeral internal instance IPs).
internal/example_tasks/runs/*
!internal/example_tasks/runs/report.html
internal/example_tasks/runs-*/

# Demo scratch: `scripts/internal/space_pallet_demo.py` makes its output dir the project dir,
# so a per-project daemon state dir lands beside the committed frames.
internal/media/space-demo/.usd-cli/

# Render temp exports + probe scratch (written next to assets / into .usd-cli during renders)
.usd-cli_render_*.usd[ac]
.usd-cli_render_*.usda
.ov_render_*.usd[ac]
.3dsc_render_*.usd[ac]
.usd-cli/package_probe/
.ov/package_probe/
.3dsc/package_probe/
.usd-cli/*.usd
.ov/*.usd
.3dsc/*.usd
horde_ovrtx_instances.json
.gstack/
